Subject: [PATCH] Patch player respawn position chunk load process hang

The base logic attempts to search for a random location within the configured spawn radius

However this also assumes it can create new chunks, which in our case it can't. So this process can loop while the process hangs and the server eventually crashes.

diff --git a/net/minecraft/server/level/ServerPlayer.java b/net/minecraft/server/level/ServerPlayer.java
index 3de65c4025be91d938a350c884975cb6edc234d3..73911a1783524a3f9ba26c424b65f443831c68ef 100644
--- a/net/minecraft/server/level/ServerPlayer.java
+++ b/net/minecraft/server/level/ServerPlayer.java
@@ -471,6 +471,8 @@ public class ServerPlayer extends Player implements ca.spottedleaf.moonrise.patc
             int coprime = this.getCoprime(i);
             int randomInt = RandomSource.create().nextInt(i);
 
+            coprime = 0; // Archive - Disable respawn pos adjustment
+
             for (int i1 = 0; i1 < i; i1++) {
                 int i2 = (randomInt + coprime * i1) % i;
                 int i3 = i2 % (max * 2 + 1);
